+## Waiting on the user
+
+Rows 1 and 2 (accept or turn down in words) move a line of `evals/entrance/charter.md`: its closed surface is seven handoffs and it lists no accept or turn-down among the model's free choices, so the model would gain the decision a tap with the proposal id holds today. Only the user moves it.
+
+Built (not yet committed; the working copy is not a git repository):
+
+| Part | Where |
+|---|---|
+| A proposal ended unanswered is `stopped`, an existing ending, never *cut* | `Negotiation.close`; CONTEXT.md (Ending), ADR-0007 item 7 |
+| A new ask over an open proposal follows it in its negotiation | `Negotiation.open` |
+| Reporting the adapted workout ends the adaptation; a tap after it is `SUPERSEDED` | `Negotiation.lapsed`, `bot.reported`, `mesocycles.moved_on` |
+| *Solo 30 minuti* gone; one set of two buttons | `bot.BUTTONS` |
+
+Left once the line is decided: rows 1–2, the entrance seeing the open proposal, the README table's written answers, the eval-set rows and the paid `adapt` pass.
 
